==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 14 seconds<sup>420f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*40 [[Snowball]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*20 [[Snowball]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'mammoth]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 11.67~13.33 seconds<sup>350f~400f</sup>.
**20 [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 11.67~13.33 seconds<sup>350f~400f</sup>.
**30 [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 11.67~13.33 seconds<sup>350f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Ice Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stronger [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]] do not respawn and due to the difference in attack range, the player can focus on attacking the Mammothe, then the Icy Doge.

Make sure to spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] and other cheap units to block the Snowballs.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Cats in the Snow]] stages, Buddha of Romance's Japanese name, Romance no Hotokesama ("Buddha of Romance"), is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/T8yZWCg85Cs Romance no Kamisama] ("Cupid of Romance") by [[wikipedia:Kohmi Hirose|Kohmi Hirose]].

